libhttpserver
------------------------------------------
libhttpserver is a small C++ library for embedding RESTful HTTP server
functionality into applications.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgnutls30-3.8.13-1
  libhttpserver-devel-2.0.1-1bl1
  libhttpserver2-2.0.1-1bl1
  libmicrohttpd-devel-1.0.10-1bl1
  libmicrohttpd12-1.0.10-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libmicrohttpd-devel-1.0.10-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/etr/libhttpserver

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/etr/libhttpserver/archive/refs/tags/2.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libhttpserver-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libhttpserver-2.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libhttpserver-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhttpserver-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhttpserver2-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhttpserver-devel-2.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

